  "details": "Entering the menu is cumbersome and gives trouble makers additional time to disrupt instances. There are two possible ways to greatly enhance moderation speed:\n\nMethod 1: Add 4 hot keys for all the types of moderation options (warn, kick, force mute, ban)\n\nMethod 2: Add 1 new hot key to moderate. It brings up a target cursor, you target the player, it displays a menu with all the available moderation actions you can perform.\n\nEither of these methods would greatly improve the ability for instance moderators to quickly remove trouble users from an instance.",
